        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bernhard Cossmann, Bernhard Sekles\n- Organizations: Dr. Hoch's Konservatorium, Hoch Conservatory\n- Roles: co-founder, teacher, composer\n\nFacts:\n- Bernhard Cossmann co-founded Dr. Hoch's Konservatorium.\n- A teacher on the staff of Dr. Hoch's Konservatorium was the first person to publicly perform any work by composer Bernhard Sekles.\n- Bernhard Sekles was a composer whose work received its first public performance from that teacher.",
